  "description": "DISGUJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H57 N20 O19 Tb4 3+,3(Cl1 O4 1-),6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 5 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.531-3.630 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.64-101.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C52H69Cl3N20O37Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
